  m_text: "Welcome to the Bergen-Belsen Memorial AR Experience.\\nThis application
    facilitates historical site exploration through three distinct guidance modes:\\n\\n\u2022
    Personal: A 3D companion leads you step-by-step along the paths.\\n\u2022 Intermediate:
    A 3D hologram avatar appears next to selected headstones on-demand.\\n\u2022
    Impersonal: Autonomous exploration guided by 2D map views and data streams.\\n\\nSelect
    a mode below and tap Start Experience to begin."
